D.  What the deep field gives, for the mechanism
==============================================================================
  canonical column a0/(2 pi G) = 106.9 Msun/pc^2  (the same for every galaxy)
            pressure scale a0^2/(8 pi G) = 5.2232e-12 Pa = rho_Lambda c^2/(32 pi) at kappa = 1/2
  alt       column a0/(2 pi G) = 129.1 Msun/pc^2  (the same for every galaxy)
            pressure scale a0^2/(8 pi G) = 7.6284e-12 Pa = rho_Lambda c^2/(32 pi) at kappa = 1/2

kappa = 1/2 FITTED; not theory closed. Adopts nothing.
